 "summary_en": "The pages I could read show no sign of a referral rule for stereotactic radiotherapy in Satakunta or at Tyks. Tyks's lung cancer pathway page says only that radiotherapy can be given when surgery does not suit the patient. Satasairaala's radiotherapy unit works with Tyks, and some of its patients are treated in Turku. On the effect, Dutch registry data (Annals of Oncology, 2012) show 7 percentage points fewer untreated elderly stage I patients once stereotactic radiotherapy was available; the gain for all patients was not measured.",
